Note: this licence covers what this repository adds: the driver, the scripts,
the test programs and the documents under waterbox/, tests/ and docs/.
waterbox/driver/memfs.cpp and memfs.h come from chimera-core-xenia (which
took them from chimera-core-vita3k), and waterbox/gl-host.c from
chimera-core-dolphin, by the same author under the same licence.
waterbox/glad/ is code generated by glad (https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad),
whose output is under the terms in waterbox/glad/LICENSE.

The patches/ directory changes Cemu (https://github.com/cemu-project/Cemu),
whose files are under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
(extern/cemu/LICENSE.txt); the patches are offered under the same terms.

A package built from this repository will contain Cemu and the libraries it
links; their licences will be listed in waterbox/package-licenses.json and
carried in the package. It will contain no game, no system software, no font
of the console's and no key.
